1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:09,629
On Linux, macOS, W S L two, or Termux, you run one install command from the
Hermes docs site, then reload your shell and type hermes to start chatting.

2
00:00:09,629 --> 00:00:16,665
On Windows, there is a native PowerShell installer that
bundles everything, including Python, Node, and a portable Git.

3
00:00:16,665 --> 00:00:19,089
Day to day, you need only a few commands.

4
00:00:19,089 --> 00:00:29,023
Hermes model to switch providers, hermes gateway to start messaging, hermes setup for
the full wizard, hermes update to upgrade, and hermes doctor to diagnose problems.

5
00:00:29,023 --> 00:00:30,557
Want to skip collecting five A P I keys?

6
00:00:30,557 --> 00:00:32,981
Run hermes setup with the portal flag.

7
00:00:32,981 --> 00:00:43,300
One Nous Portal subscription gives you three hundred plus models, plus web
search, image generation, speech, and a cloud browser through the Tool Gateway.

8
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:47,024
Full docs are on the Hermes site, and the
community lives on Discord.

9
00:00:47,024 --> 00:00:50,428
Thank you for watching, and happy building
with Hermes Agent.

